                <li>✨ Generous spacing (24px card padding)</li>
                <li>🎯 Single focus per screen</li>
                <li>🔍 Clear visual hierarchy</li>
                <li>💎 Subtle shadows for depth</li>
            </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="mockup-grid">
            <div class="mockup-card">
