<div
  role="status"
  aria-live="polite"
  aria-atomic="true"
  className="sr-only"
>
  {statusMessage}
</div>

{/* Assertive announcements (critical errors) */}
<div
  role="alert"
  aria-live="assertive"
  aria-atomic="true"
  className="sr-only"
>
  {errorMessage}
</div>
```

**Screen Reader Announcements:**
- New chat messages announced when complete (not character-by-character during streaming)
- Action results announced ("Timesheet submitted successfully")
- Loading states announced ("Loading approval requests")
- Error recovery announced ("Retrying connection... Attempt 2 of 3")

**Landmark Regions:**
