<main role="main"><!-- Primary content --></main>
<aside role="complementary" aria-label="Dashboard panel"><!-- Sidebar --></aside>
<footer role="contentinfo"><!-- Footer --></footer>
```

#### Touch Target Sizes

**Minimum Sizes:**
- Mobile: **48x48px** minimum (iOS and Material Design standard)
- Tablet: **44x44px** minimum (WCAG 2.1 Level AAA, but we exceed it)
- Desktop: **24x24px** acceptable for mouse, but we maintain 44x44px for consistency

**Implementation:**
```tsx
